<%- include("../partials/head") %>
<%- include("../partials/navbar") %>

      <main class="site-main roadmap-page">
        <section class="roadmap-intro" aria-labelledby="roadmap-title">
          <div class="roadmap-intro__content">
            <p class="section-kicker">The road ahead</p>
            <h1 id="roadmap-title">Fallout is better together.</h1>
            <p>See what Commonwealth Online is building, from exploring with friends to a more connected Commonwealth.</p>
            <a class="co-btn co-btn--primary" href="#roadmap-features">Explore the roadmap <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
          <figure class="roadmap-intro__image">
            <img src="/assets/images/playerimages/UserOptcron-1.webp" alt="Two Commonwealth Online players on a ruined road" width="1920" height="1080" />
            <figcaption>Community screenshot</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </section>

        <nav class="roadmap-nav" aria-label="Roadmap sections">
          <a href="#play-together">Play together</a>
          <a href="#shared-world">A shared world</a>
          <a href="#road-ahead">The road ahead</a>
        </nav>

        <div id="roadmap-features" class="roadmap-content">
          <div class="roadmap-heading">
            <p class="section-kicker">Development roadmap</p>
            <h2>What we're building</h2>
            <p>Commonwealth Online is in active development. These features are at different stages, and the development branch may contain work that has not reached a public release. Plans and priorities can change. Each player still runs their own game; full campaign co-op is not available. “Implemented · testing” means the development branch contains the feature; it does not guarantee it is in a public release.</p>
          </div>

          <section id="play-together" class="roadmap-section" aria-labelledby="play-together-title">
            <div class="roadmap-section__heading">
              <span class="roadmap-section__number">01</span>
              <div><p class="section-kicker">Meet up in the wasteland</p><h2 id="play-together-title">Play together</h2><p>The essentials for finding a server, making a character and sharing the Commonwealth.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="roadmap-cards">
              <article id="foundation" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Implemented · testing</span><h3>Join a world</h3><p>Find a server or host a session, then explore the Commonwealth alongside other players.</p></article>
              <article id="replication" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Implemented · testing</span><h3>Bring your character</h3><p>See other players move through the world with their own appearance, clothing and equipment.</p></article>
              <article id="operations" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Implemented · testing</span><h3>Host your way</h3><p>Server browsing and hosting tools help players connect and give hosts ways to manage a session.</p></article>
              <article id="social" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Experimental</span><h3>Talk and team up</h3><p>Voice and text chat, friends and factions are being tested and refined to help players stay connected.</p></article>
              <article id="player-control" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">In development</span><h3>Make it your session</h3><p>In-game settings, a multiplayer map and administration tools give players and hosts more control.</p></article>
              <article id="combat-capacity" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">In development</span><h3>Fight and survive</h3><p>Combat, player movement and reviving teammates are being developed and refined for multiplayer.</p></article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section id="shared-world" class="roadmap-section" aria-labelledby="shared-world-title">
            <div class="roadmap-section__heading">
              <span class="roadmap-section__number">02</span>
              <div><p class="section-kicker">More to do together</p><h2 id="shared-world-title">A shared world</h2><p>Building a world where your actions and adventures can matter to the people playing with you.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="roadmap-cards">
              <article id="living-commonwealth" class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">In development</span><h3>Enemies and NPCs</h3><p>Work is underway on sharing characters, creatures and combat across players' games.</p></article>
              <article class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">In development</span><h3>Quests and progress</h3><p>Quest sharing is being developed so groups can experience more of the Commonwealth together.</p></article>
              <article class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">In development</span><h3>Trade and settlements</h3><p>Trading and settlement systems are being developed for a more cooperative world.</p></article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section id="road-ahead" class="roadmap-section roadmap-future" aria-labelledby="road-ahead-title">
            <div id="long-horizon" class="roadmap-section__heading">
              <span class="roadmap-section__number">03</span>
              <div><p class="section-kicker">Looking forward</p><h2 id="road-ahead-title">The road ahead</h2><p>Making these systems reliable together is ongoing work. Future improvements depend on testing, feedback and what the team learns along the way.</p></div>
            </div>
            <div class="roadmap-cards roadmap-future__cards"><article class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Planned</span><h3>More combat details</h3><p>Improve how weapons and combat actions appear to other players.</p></article><article class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Planned</span><h3>Power armor</h3><p>Work toward showing power armor and its state to other players.</p></article><article class="roadmap-card"><span class="roadmap-card__tag">Possible later</span><h3>More ways to play</h3><p>Explore broader mod compatibility, arena sessions and support for more players.</p></article></div><div class="roadmap-actions"><a class="co-btn co-btn--primary" href="#" data-co-link="nexus">Download the mod</a><a class="co-btn co-btn--ghost" href="/updates">Read project updates</a><a class="co-btn co-btn--ghost" href="/servers">Find a server</a></div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>

